.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

example

# generated native folders
/ios
/android

# Source art for scripts/build-characters.mjs. ~35 MB of glTF from the creator's
# public Drive; the built assets/characters/*.glb are what ships.
.character-cache/

# CC0 source archives for scripts/build-venue.mjs. The optimised venue bundle and
# its manifest/licence under assets/venues/ are committed; downloaded source is not.
.venue-cache/
# Raw Overpass answers for Cubbon Park, 2.2 MB. NOT committed, unlike the city's:
# `scripts/build-cubbon.mjs --offline` needs them, but the built `park.json` is 24 KB
# and IS committed, so a clone can draw the park without them. Refetching takes a
# minute and the script pins the OSM way id, so it comes back the same.
.cubbon-cache/
